 "description": "48-port serial console server, 1RU. The Rear carries the 48 RJ45 serial ports in two rows of 24, in three blocks of eight columns, odd numbers above even. It also has two Ethernet RJ45 ports, two SFP cages and two AC inlets each with a rocker switch. Modelled as the dual-AC build with neither Wi-Fi nor a cellular modem, ZPE-NSCP-T48R-STND-DAC, the one the held photograph shows. No held document shows the 48-port Front.",
